the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move jump with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing*, *a fourth thing*, *a fifth thing* and *a sixth thing* is made; known as jump.
    the move move with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing* and *a fourth thing* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* cell *a second thing* with *a third thing*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a role* is the score of *a score*; known as score.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move jump with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing*, *a fourth thing*, *a fifth thing* and *a sixth thing* is legal; known as legal_jump.
    the move move with *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing* and *a fourth thing* is legal; known as legal_move.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a thing* forward *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* jumpable *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing* with *a fifth thing* with *a sixth thing*.
    the nextrank of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the nextfile of *a second thing*.
    *a thing* home *a second thing* with *a third thing*.
    *a thing* scoreplus *a second thing*.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base chinook includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/chinook.hrf".

a thing forward a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the thing is the nextfile of the third thing.

a thing forward a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the thing.

a thing jumpable a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the sixth thing
    and the thing is the nextfile of the third thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the fifth thing.

a thing jumpable a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing with a fifth thing with a sixth thing if
    the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the sixth thing
    and the fifth thing is the nextfile of the third thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the thing.

