the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is legal at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with red at the time
    and the thing jumpable the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing with the fifth thing with the sixth thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with red at the time
    and the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with b at the time.

the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is legal at a time if
    blue is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with blue at the time
    and the fifth thing jumpable the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with blue at the time
    and the fifth thing cell the sixth thing with b at the time.

the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with red at the time
    and the thing forward the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with b at the time.

the move move with a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    blue is a control at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with blue at the time
    and the third thing forward the fourth thing with the thing with the second thing
    and the third thing cell the fourth thing with b at the time.

the goal of red is a number at a time if
    red is the score of the number at the time.

the goal of blue is a number at a time if
    blue is the score of the number at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    41 is a step at the time.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
