    and a role is a control
then the eighth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the seventh thing is a step.

when the move jump with a thing, a second thing, a third thing, a fourth thing, a fifth thing and a sixth thing is made
    and red is a control
    and a role is a control
then blue is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

